{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "Thank you, Maya. Before we go further on interview protocols, I need to share something important on the employment-counsel side. I confirmed this morning that the implicated vice president has retained separate counsel and will not participate in a company interview without that counsel's written consent. I had been waiting for the engagement letter to be filed before circulating this, but given that we're discussing executive-interview protocols now, it's critical that everyone be aware. This directly affects any protocol we propose -- we cannot assume the VP will be available for interview on our timeline, and we need to factor in the coordination required with personal counsel before any interview can proceed."}
```

